        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7506, Brushed Stainless Steel Loft Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Loft Stainless Steel Cup Pull has a brushed stainless steel finish that makes it especially durable. A great choice for high-traffic areas, the Brushed Stainless Steel Loft Cup Pull is easy to maintain. This mid-sized flush pull is 4 inches tall and 2 inches wide. It is mortised into the face of the door with a 1/16 inch projection, making the Loft Flush Pull ideal for sliding pocket doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-75026-SM.jpg?v=1704354610\" width=\"408\" height=\"261\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia 7506 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Omnia <a href=\"/products/4-3-4-x-1-9-16-oval-stainless-steel-cup-pull-omnia-7505\"><b>Contemporary Oval Stainless Steel Cup Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 7506 Stainless Loft Flush Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: 1/16\" Thick Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 4\" (101 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2\" (51 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 15/32\"(12 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 3/8\" (10 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Length: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lip: 3/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7506-template.pdf?v=1704262252\"><b>Omnia 7506 Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
